Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:01:01.71,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,54)\fad(200,0)\fnRoundHog SemiBold\fs34\c&H001CCEFF}Alex Jung (Unikraft)
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:01:01.71,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“In-person events beat
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:01:01.71,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}AI-written outbound”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,But then on the whole
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.04,0:00:01.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,GTM front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.80,0:00:02.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think, I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.78,0:00:03.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,GTM engineering has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:05.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,blown up in terms of a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.06,0:00:06.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,whole new space
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.32,0:00:07.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,I don't think even the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:09.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,term GTM engineer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:09.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,existed, what
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.70,0:00:11.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,six months ago properly?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:13.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,And now there's GTM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:14.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,engineer meetups and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.18,0:00:15.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,everyone's sharing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:16.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,techniques and I think
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.22,0:00:16.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,that's because there's a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.88,0:00:18.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,big power that people
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.04,0:00:19.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,are getting in terms of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.28,0:00:20.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,changing roles and we're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:21.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,all architects and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.42,0:00:22.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,accessing more parts of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:22.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,the company
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.66,0:00:23.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.81,0:00:24.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's definitely an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:25.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,interesting space
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.17,0:00:26.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,obviously automation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.09,0:00:28.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,but at the same time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.03,0:00:30.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,I don't like getting AI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:31.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,slop in my inbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:32.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,I don't think anybody
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.52,0:00:34.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,does. Even if you remove
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:36.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,the EM dashes or
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:37.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,whatever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:38.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,we actually care more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.28,0:00:39.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,about having
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.18,0:00:40.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,handwritten
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.02,0:00:40.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,personal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.44,0:00:41.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,whatever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.06,0:00:42.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,moments like this where
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.38,0:00:43.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can talk with real
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.52,0:00:45.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,people is so much more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:45.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,important.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.88,0:00:47.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,than getting whatever my
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.04,0:00:47.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,inbox, and my inbox
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.72,0:00:48.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,I swear, since this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:49.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,morning, a thousand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.48,0:00:49.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,emails of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:51.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,like, bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:52.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,And, like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:53.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,yeah, that's not going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.40,0:00:53.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,to scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.78,0:00:54.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's going to continue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:55.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,to grow like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.18,0:00:56.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,So I think it's actually
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.24,0:00:57.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,more important to have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.06,0:00:57.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,like, physical
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:00:59.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,in-present events than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.96,0:01:00.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,actually all this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.64,0:01:01.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,outbound stuff.
